Drag the Path or Tubeway tool as usual and it routes around trees, buildings and other obstacles instead of drawing the vanilla straight L. It reuses existing paths and bridges, goes under platforms, and connects to other levels through existing stairs. Hold [b]Alt[/b] for the vanilla L (swappable in the mod settings).

Requires Harmony and Mod Settings.

[i]Disclaimer: Mostly written by AI (Claude). Play-tested and code reviewed but not exhaustively.[/i]
